1
00:00:00,729 --> 00:00:03,329
(Sheldon:)and finds out
I don't have an Uncle Harvey?

2
00:00:03,331 --> 00:00:06,631
(Leonard:)The dealer doesn't care,
Kripke has no authority over us,

3
00:00:06,635 --> 00:00:08,505
(Leonard:)and you being related
to a metal container

4
00:00:08,503 --> 00:00:11,503
(Leonard:)would explain a lot.

5
00:00:11,506 --> 00:00:14,876
(Leonard:)Help me hook this up.

6
00:00:14,876 --> 00:00:16,076
(Sheldon:)Uh-oh.
What?

7
00:00:16,077 --> 00:00:18,177
(Sheldon:)Well, did you see this sticker?
What is it?

8
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:20,779
(Sheldon:)It's partially torn off, but
the segment that remains reads:

9
00:00:20,782 --> 00:00:23,582
“Property of”
and the letter “U.”

10
00:00:23,585 --> 00:00:25,415
(Leonard:)It's probably USC or UCLA.

11
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,990
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but what if it's
“Property of U.S. Government”?

12
00:00:27,989 --> 00:00:30,719
(Sheldon:)There's a national helium
reserve in Amarillo, Texas.

13
00:00:30,725 --> 00:00:32,155
(Sheldon:)If this was stolen from there,

14
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,160
(Sheldon:)we're accessories
to a federal crime.

15
00:00:34,162 --> 00:00:35,662
(Leonard:)Let's not jump to conclusions.

16
00:00:35,664 --> 00:00:37,234
A lot of things start with “U.”

17
00:00:37,232 --> 00:00:38,262
(Sheldon:)That's true.

18
00:00:38,266 --> 00:00:40,336
(Sheldon:)There's the U.S. Air Force,

19
00:00:40,335 --> 00:00:42,805
U.S. Department of Defense,
U.S. Navy,

20
00:00:42,804 --> 00:00:45,134
“you” and I
are going to jail.

21
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,640
(Leonard:)Listen, we can
do the experiment as planned

22
00:00:47,642 --> 00:00:49,412
(Leonard:)and beat the Swedish team
to the punch,

23
00:00:49,411 --> 00:00:51,641
(Leonard:)or we can kiss our dreams
good-bye because we were

24
00:00:51,646 --> 00:00:53,816
(Leonard:)to afraid to break a few rules.

25
00:00:57,552 --> 00:01:02,022
(Leonard:)Ma'am.

